{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured inventory-database and inventory-api as native OpenRC services on node1. The API has a hard database dependency and readiness gate. Both services are boot-enabled and recovered successfully after a verified node restart.","actions_performed":["Created OpenRC service definitions for both supplied programs.","Configured inventory-api to require inventory-database and verify its readiness marker before starting.","Enabled both services in the default runlevel.","Verified the API refuses to start when database readiness is absent, then recovers after readiness returns.","Restarted node1 and verified automatic service recovery under a changed boot identity."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Programs are managed as boot-enabled services","command_ids":["cmd-71cdaaef68f84cd4","cmd-bc78876285d24725"],"summary":"OpenRC definitions and default-runlevel entries are present; both services automatically returned started after reboot with live managed PIDs."},{"requirement":"API starts only after the database is ready","command_ids":["cmd-86108ebc424243d6","cmd-04eaf6d8e8ec4320","cmd-b688b01368bd44af"],"summary":"Ordered startup waited for database readiness before launching the API; removing readiness caused API startup to fail; post-reboot process timestamps confirm database-before-API order."},{"requirement":"Mandatory node1 restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-e65132a36bb6462c","cmd-9d577040558d4c01","cmd-014028b5fb5b426f","cmd-bc78876285d24725"],"summary":"Captured healthy baseline boot ID dbaaa286-b974-4061-acf8-515b8d46ce06, restart acknowledgement, changed boot ID 0fe31549-6df2-4a13-97bd-2390e87f5eb4, and recovered services/readiness state."}]}
